        <mxCell id="business_rules_note" value="Sponsor-confirmed delivery and refund rules (02 Jul 2026)&lt;br&gt;- CLOUD / RECORD: refund only within 72 hours of purchase and while watch progress is at most 10%.&lt;br&gt;- LIVE: refund only when requested at least 72 hours before the start; an optional RECORD does not replace the LIVE rule.&lt;br&gt;- LOCAL: non-refundable; a completed download is retained as fulfilment evidence.&lt;br&gt;- Direct CONTENT purchase: refund within 24 hours only before first access.&lt;br&gt;- Points are permanent, non-withdrawable, and usable only inside Course / Content purchases.&lt;br&gt;- The seller receives 100% of item points. Holds release by deadline, watch threshold, first access, or an immediate non-refundable rule.&lt;br&gt;- Course / Content refunds reverse points. Fiat refunds are admin-only for duplicate charges or payment / crediting anomalies." style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#98A2B3;fillColor=#F8FAFC;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=12;fontColor=#344054;fontStyle=0;spacing=6;rounded=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
